mply public game source.","Access type","unavailable","access","section","Platform listing is not game source — DRM-free describes distribution restrictions, not whether complete source or reusable assets are available.","service","demo",[76],{"_57":77,"_25":78,"_79":80},"Browse games on GOG","https://www.gog.com/en/games","note","Desktop game catalog. Check the individual product and system requirements rather than assuming browser play.","tutorial",[83],{"_57":84,"_25":85,"_79":86},"Submit a game to GOG","https://www.gog.com/submit-your-game","Official submission page with an embedded developer form. Catalog inclusion requires a separate publishing decision.","Source reviewed","2026-10-20","verified","metadata","list","Tracks","ordered",false,[97,98],"dimensions","2D","3D","Development stages",[102],"stages","Build & release","Topics",[106,107,108],"tags","Publishing","Game discovery","Desktop games","Further reading",[111,112],{"_57":77,"_25":78},{"_57":84,"_25":113},"https://lp.gog.com/submit-your-game/en","Project source",[116],{"_57":114,"_25":85},"Why it belongs here","GOG is a curated digital game store with DRM-free releases and an optional desktop client. The official submission form is the developer entry point for proposing a game; submitting it does not guarantee acceptance or immediate publication. Verify each game's supported operating systems, edition, and release status. DRM-free distribution is different from publishing the game's source code.","detail","guidance","Resource type","Community","Category","Game production","category","lead","summary","name","production","community",[144,145],{"_81":139,"_74":140,"_32":141},[106,107,108],[138],[136,137],"2d","3d","ship",{"_57":84,"_25":85,"_17":73,"_79":86},{"_57":77,"_25":78,"_17":73,"_79":80},{"_57":142,"_17":69,"_79":143},"Platform listing is not game source","DRM-free describes distribution restrictions, not whether complete source or reusable assets are available.",{"_57":77,"_25":78},{"_57":84,"_